ld 6 days, QA 4 days, Release 1 day; each phase inclusive of its duration in\n  business days, next phase starting the next business day, weekends and the 2026-10-12\n  company planning-day holiday excluded) yields a launch date of 2026-10-23, one business\n  day later than recorded. Leadership should confirm the correct launch date before it is\n  communicated externally.\n- **Security figures:** the 95.0% resolution rate (76 of 80 incidents) matches the packet's\n  own summary and required no correction.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":620,"cache_read_input_tokens":35057,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":620},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"79132d75-de62-4e3d-8074-5fc08e039223","uuid":"b7828b62-e88b-4cff-976d-a0e433083b8a","timestamp":"2026-08-22T06:39:01.449Z","request_id":"req_011CeHKvcpa1xVh3oZ2ztRCj"}
